		(uuid "96d9460c-a071-468e-9dae-ed42e05b5343")
	)
	(text "- IMU IC (Intertial measurement unit) containing a \nprogrammable gyroscope, accelerometer, and a digital low \npass filter. Operates over I2C at 100 KHz with address 0x68.\n\n- Environmental sensor IC containing a programmable \npressure, humidity, and temperature measurements with\na filter. Operates over I2C at 100 KHz with address 0x76.\n\n "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.456 122.682 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b7caf13a-6fc6-41e7-92fb-3572c10a799e")
	)
	(text "- 4 Mb of NOR flash over 3-wire SPI at 1 MHz.\n\n- MicroSD connector for extracting memory from flash IC.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 39.624 0)
		(effects
			(font
